{"type":"text","timestamp":1790403681657,"sessionID":"ses_f23a0c345ffeGhpH6J2yujqGca","part":{"id":"prt_0dc601d64001sWt5RRZU6Da0LX","messageID":"msg_0dc5fc3e90015W3nZXxHnZIiFl","sessionID":"ses_f23a0c345ffeGhpH6J2yujqGca","type":"text","text":"The harness is intentionally skeletal. The drag flow needs one important invariant: the card records its `Grip` index before leaving the container, while base-state entry owns reparenting it home after cancellation. I’ll implement that flow and preserve the grab offset so dragging does not snap the card’s corner to the cursor.","time":{"start":1790403681636,"end":1790403681638},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_03094760df496dd2016ab76460ece88196a6ac92eb16ede89f","phase":"commentary"}}}}
