{"type":"text","timestamp":1790403822091,"sessionID":"ses_f23a0c345ffeGhpH6J2yujqGca","part":{"id":"prt_0dc6241fd001CO5Zm0TFevcSH8","messageID":"msg_0dc601d76001B2GdutI4ts2lva","sessionID":"ses_f23a0c345ffeGhpH6J2yujqGca","type":"text","text":"I’m editing the state machine, four active card states, `CardUI`, and `Hand` together so signal ownership and transition timing stay consistent. The released state will consume the release input only after the minimum drag duration, while invalid drops return through base state and the hand restores the original sibling index.","time":{"start":1790403822077,"end":1790403822080},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_03094760df496dd2016ab764c693688196ac3505fa4a41b224","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790403822122,"sessionID":"ses_f23a0c345ffeGhpH6J2yujqGca","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_8vO2YJWqJYRCQlwIcsfAl3bB","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_state_machine.gd\n@@\n var current_state\n var states := {}\n@@\n func init(card_ui) -> void:\n \tfor child in get_children():\n \t\tstates[child.state] = child\n \t\tchild.card_ui = card_ui\n+\t\tchild.transition_requested.connect(_on_transition_requested)\n+\n+\tcurrent_state = initial_state\n+\tcurrent_state.enter()\n@@\n-func on_input(_event: InputEvent) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+func on_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n+\tif current_state:\n+\t\tcurrent_state.on_input(event)\n@@\n-func on_gui_input(_event: InputEvent) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+func on_gui_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n+\tif current_state:\n+\t\tcurrent_state.on_gui_input(event)\n@@\n func on_mouse_entered() -> void:\n-\tpass\n+\tif current_state:\n+\t\tcurrent_state.on_mouse_entered()\n@@\n func on_mouse_exited() -> void:\n-\tpass\n+\tif current_state:\n+\t\tcurrent_state.on_mouse_exited()\n@@\n-func _on_transition_requested(_from, _to: int) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+func _on_transition_requested(from, to: int) -> void:\n+\tif from != current_state or not states.has(to):\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tcurrent_state.exit()\n+\tcurrent_state = states[to]\n+\tcurrent_state.enter()\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_ui.gd\n@@\n func _ready() -> void:\n-\tpass\n+\tcard_state_machine.init(self)\n@@\n-func _input(_event: InputEvent) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+func _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n+\tcard_state_machine.on_input(event)\n@@\n-func _on_gui_input(_event: InputEvent) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+func _on_gui_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n+\tcard_state_machine.on_gui_input(event)\n@@\n func _on_mouse_entered() -> void:\n-\tpass\n+\tcard_state_machine.on_mouse_entered()\n@@\n func _on_mouse_exited() -> void:\n-\tpass\n+\tcard_state_machine.on_mouse_exited()\n@@\n-func _on_drop_point_detector_area_entered(_area: Area2D) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+func _on_drop_point_detector_area_entered(area: Area2D) -> void:\n+\tif not targets.has(area):\n+\t\ttargets.append(area)\n@@\n-func _on_drop_point_detector_area_exited(_area: Area2D) -> void:\n-\tpass\n+func _on_drop_point_detector_area_exited(area: Area2D) -> void:\n+\ttargets.erase(area)\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_base_state.gd\n@@\n extends \"res://scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd\"\n+\n+\n+func enter() -> void:\n+\tcard_ui.drop_point_detector.monitoring = false\n+\tcard_ui.reparent_requested.emit(card_ui)\n+\n+\n+func on_gui_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n+\tif event.is_action_pressed(\"left_mouse\"):\n+\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n+\t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, CardState.State.CLICKED)\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_clicked_state.gd\n@@\n extends \"res://scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd\"\n+\n+\n+func enter() -> void:\n+\tcard_ui.original_index = card_ui.get_index()\n+\tcard_ui.drop_point_detector.monitoring = true\n+\n+\n+func on_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n+\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n+\t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, CardState.State.DRAGGING)\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd\n@@\n const DRAG_MINIMUM_THRESHOLD := 0.06\n+\n+var elapsed := 0.0\n+var mouse_offset := Vector2.ZERO\n+\n+\n+func enter() -> void:\n+\telapsed = 0.0\n+\tmouse_offset = card_ui.get_global_mouse_position() - card_ui.global_position\n+\tcard_ui.reparent_requested.emit(card_ui)\n+\tcard_ui.drop_point_detector.monitoring = true\n+\tcard_ui.global_position = card_ui.get_global_mouse_position() - mouse_offset\n+\n+\n+func on_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n+\telapsed += get_process_delta_time()\n+\tcard_ui.global_position = card_ui.get_global_mouse_position() - mouse_offset\n+\n+\tif event.is_action_presse